@startuml milestone-2-sequence

title Shipping Oracle — Pull-based Flow (Milestone 2)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Consumer" as C
participant "Oracle API" as O
participant "Shippo API" as S
participant "Cardano Ledger" as L
participant "Oracle\nValidator" as V

C -> O: GET /v1/shipment?carrier=X&tracking_number=Y
O -> S: GET /tracks/X/Y
S --> O: TrackingStatus

note over O
  hash(carrier), hash(tracking_number)
  build OracleData
  serialise_data → CBOR
  sign w/ Ed25519
end note

O --> C: { data, plaintext, signature, public_key, cbor_hex }

note over C
  Build tx:
  • reference_input = governance UTxO (NFT)
  • reference_script = oracle validator
  • withdrawal 0 ADA from script reward addr
  • redeemer = OracleRedeemer { data, signature }
end note

C -> L: Submit tx
L -> V: Run withdraw(redeemer, tx)
V -> L: Read governance UTxO via NFT

note over V
  serialise_data(redeemer.data)
  verify_ed25519_signature(oracle_vk, msg, sig)
end note

V --> L: ok
L --> C: tx accepted

@enduml
